<p>Travellers whose priority was direct beach access, rather than a town-centre or nightlife-focused stay, are the clearest fit for this hotel, and that same beachfront convenience carries through to departure day — the short 20-minute transfer and the hotel's proximity to the water mean there's comparatively little logistics involved in getting from a final swim to the airport.</p>
